    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T03:36:58.368583+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers click derivatives headlines not for mechanics or risk education but to track the global race to legitimize retail and institutional access — who just got a license, which country just capped leverage, and which DEX just cracked the top of a market that was previously CEX-only territory.",
